# April O'Neil, Kunoichi Trainee: "When April O'Neil enters, scry 2" puts Lightning Bolt (second) on the bottom and keeps Island
# on top (CR 701.22a). "Can't be blocked by creatures with power 3 or greater" (CR 509.1b): Bot2's Cathar Commando (3/1)
# may not block her, its Ornithopter (power 0) may. The restriction is April's alone: Commando does block Bot1's Action News
# Crew, and the two trade.

